=2 Notes
You must zone after completing the previous quest before you are allowed to start this quest.
=2 Walkthrough
* Talk to {n:Nantoto} at H-8 in {z:Lower Jeuno} after you have completed 100 unique {p:Records of Eminence} quests.
* She asks you to kill shadows in {z:The Eldieme Necropolis}.
* Kill 10 {p:Fomor|Category:Fomor} family monsters in {z:The Eldieme Necropolis}.
** You must first activate the {p:Records of Eminence} quest under **Other -> RoE Quests -> Culling The Darkness** to get credit.
* When you kill the last shadow you will complete the {p:Records of Eminence} quest and receive 1500 {p:sparks|Sparks} and 2500 {p:exp.|Experience Points}
* Report back to {n:Nantoto} for a short cutscene to complete the quest and obtain the 5 {i:Copper A.M.A.N Vouchers|Copper A.M.A.N. Voucher|8711}.

